cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bigbang, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bigbang: Distribute Packages as Meta-Packages with Dependency Ordering"
abstract: >-
  Creates meta-packages in the style of the 'tidyverse' to share collections
  of interdependent R packages as a single bundle, including internal
  toolkits used by teams and organizations. Component archives are included
  by default. Dependency graphs determine the installation order, and cycles
  and unsatisfied local version requirements are detected during generation.
  Components do not need publication in a repository or a successful R CMD
  check. The generated installer adds missing components and, by default,
  upgrades only those whose bundled version is newer than the installed
  version. External dependencies can be provided in advance or installed
  from an explicitly configured repository.
authors:
